                                                "sense_id": "7d2c2038-80f3-3257-8130-239de47be236",
                                                "text": "The first is a special—a single lighting instrument that lights a particular spot on the stage. Specials generally have no color, or a more saturated color, allowing them to stand out through other lighting onstage."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50fd32cc-1c1d-3bc7-9fd3-5a24759dd61f",
